  "worked_solution": "Recall that the equation of a hyperbolic cylinder, whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis, is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is a hyperbolic cylinder with $a=3,\\,b=4.$",
